# Old domains: when entquest.app / vocalyzer.app are added as domain aliases of this site, every
# page redirects permanently (301) to its equivalent on entsenses.app. Query strings are kept.
# Rules are checked in order; the first match wins.
https://entquest.app/cuestionarios/*      https://entsenses.app/quest/:splat           301!
https://entquest.app/cuestionarios        https://entsenses.app/quest                  301!
https://entquest.app/dashboard            https://entsenses.app/quest/buscar           301!
