https://entquest.app/bandeja              https://entsenses.app/bandeja?m=quest        301!
https://entquest.app/completar-perfil     https://entsenses.app/panel                  301!
https://entquest.app/p/*                  https://entsenses.app/                       301!
https://entquest.app/i/*                  https://entsenses.app/                       301!
https://entquest.app/*                    https://entsenses.app/:splat                 301!
https://www.entquest.app/*                https://entsenses.app/:splat                 301!
https://vocalyzer.app/evaluar             https://entsenses.app/voice/evaluar          301!
https://vocalyzer.app/informe/*           https://entsenses.app/bandeja?m=voice        301!
https://vocalyzer.app/bandeja             https://entsenses.app/bandeja?m=voice        301!
https://vocalyzer.app/imprimir-qr         https://entsenses.app/imprimir-qr?m=voice    301!
https://vocalyzer.app/p/*                 https://entsenses.app/                       301!
https://vocalyzer.app/*                   https://entsenses.app/:splat                 301!
https://www.vocalyzer.app/*               https://entsenses.app/:splat                 301!

